{"3321300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hide 'n Heist", "steam_appid": 3321300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.poster.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.webm?t=1765489886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a Thief or a Guard? Choose your side and try to outsmart your opponents with your plans! Use your role, watch your surroundings, and wait for the right moment — but be careful, your time is limited! What you do within the time limit will determine your fate. Remember, only one side wins the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/0926bcf1ec485fc722703c92db016423.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal as many valuables as you can before time runs out, stay low-key, and escape without getting caught by the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bandit shares a common ability: <strong>Disguise!</strong> Blend into the crowd and act like one of them. If you’re spotted, use your skills to escape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, You are a team! Each of you has a unique role — create the right combos as a team and confuse the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/c38202e8a55c6a2e5cb576e2982e617e.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Guard, you have one mission: <strong>Protect the Treasure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has already called in the troops, and the thieves are on a timer. Your goal is to stop the heist within this limited time and, if possible, capture the thieves! But be careful — harming innocents can have irreversible consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role wisely! Each role has unique abilities and strategies. Pick the role that best suits your playstyle and prevent the thieves from escaping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/8a137d779f28ca64ea70f28959350536.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure, which begins in the medieval era, is about to expand with brand-new themes! Different eras, different locations. Who knows when and where the thieves will strike next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/39d81491365533c54531f2ba95eee44a.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Roles to Diversify the Gameplay!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thieves Don’t Have Ten Hands: Inventory Management!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard-Exclusive Emergency Mechanic!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Themes, New Maps! (Coming Soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heists at Different Times! (How About a Night Heist?)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Play for Thieves!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy-Focused Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.poster.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.webm?t=1765489886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a Thief or a Guard? Choose your side and try to outsmart your opponents with your plans! Use your role, watch your surroundings, and wait for the right moment — but be careful, your time is limited! What you do within the time limit will determine your fate. Remember, only one side wins the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/0926bcf1ec485fc722703c92db016423.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal as many valuables as you can before time runs out, stay low-key, and escape without getting caught by the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bandit shares a common ability: <strong>Disguise!</strong> Blend into the crowd and act like one of them. If you’re spotted, use your skills to escape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, You are a team! Each of you has a unique role — create the right combos as a team and confuse the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/c38202e8a55c6a2e5cb576e2982e617e.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Guard, you have one mission: <strong>Protect the Treasure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has already called in the troops, and the thieves are on a timer. Your goal is to stop the heist within this limited time and, if possible, capture the thieves! But be careful — harming innocents can have irreversible consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role wisely! Each role has unique abilities and strategies. Pick the role that best suits your playstyle and prevent the thieves from escaping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/8a137d779f28ca64ea70f28959350536.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure, which begins in the medieval era, is about to expand with brand-new themes! Different eras, different locations. Who knows when and where the thieves will strike next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/39d81491365533c54531f2ba95eee44a.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Roles to Diversify the Gameplay!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thieves Don’t Have Ten Hands: Inventory Management!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard-Exclusive Emergency Mechanic!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Themes, New Maps! (Coming Soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heists at Different Times! (How About a Night Heist?)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Play for Thieves!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy-Focused Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "4 Thieves vs. 1 Guardian! A medieval heist game! Play as a thief, disguise yourself among the crowd, and steal the treasure, or take on the role of the guardian and hunt down the thieves! Everyone has a unique role and strategy. Find the right approach and lead your team to victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/header.jpg?t=1765489886", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/a536742d467cdb418c25b6b03f036f6651285578/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765489886", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/a536742d467cdb418c25b6b03f036f6651285578/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765489886", "website": "https://www.dointogethergames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro